# ── 100% Vercel Serverless Multiplayer (Pusher Channels) ───────────────────
# Get free credentials at https://pusher.com (100 concurrent connections, 200k msgs/day free).
# Add these 6 variables to your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.

# Server-Side Variables (used inside Next.js Route Handlers on Vercel):
PUSHER_APP_ID=your_pusher_app_id
PUSHER_KEY=your_pusher_key
PUSHER_SECRET=your_pusher_secret
PUSHER_CLUSTER=mt1

# Client-Side Variables (exposed to browser for instant WebSockets):
NEXT_PUBLIC_PUSHER_KEY=your_pusher_key
NEXT_PUBLIC_PUSHER_CLUSTER=mt1
